# TD(etap-9): the previous MILITARY/POLITICS/PRODUCTION focus tree (~90
# technologies) referenced stats from the pre-pivot war system
# (MilitaryStrength, RecruitmentTime/Cost, GarrisonCapacity, TerritoryRadius,
# HitPoints on GuardTower/Fortress/Castle) that no longer exist. The parser
# silently defaulted every unrecognized stat name to BalanceStat::BuildTime,
# so those ~90 techs were quietly misapplying random build-time multipliers
# instead of doing what their description said — a real bug, not just dead
# data. Removed wholesale per user decision (2026-07-12): the whole focus
# tree is getting redesigned from scratch, so it's not worth hand-remapping.
#
# What follows is a flat placeholder "cheat sheet": one minimal, disconnected
# technology per BalanceStat (see inc/economy/BalanceStats.h), titled after
# the stat it modifies, showing the correct `modifier <Stat> ...` syntax
# (including the `building`/`resource`/`category`/`unit` filter keys). None
# of these are balanced or meant to be researched as-is — replace/expand them
# when designing the real focus tree. See docs/tower_defense_design.md.

technology BuildTime
    name "BuildTime"
    description "Cheat sheet placeholder for BalanceStat::BuildTime."
    category PRODUCTION
    tags production construction
    layout_order 100
    research_time 10
    cost PAPER 10
    modifier BuildTime multiplier 0.95
end

